Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 ل 92 38 ل 0 38
